                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 10.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Imperial decree published in the Pekin Gazette July 8,
                        1900.</hi></head>
                <p>The posts about Tientsin are of extreme importance. Troops are to be massed for
                    their defense. The 72 fire companies, numbering over 10,000 men, all animated by
                    a spirit of patriotism, united with the Boxers, would swell the strength of the
                    defense and turn the edge of the enemy.</p>
            </div>
